---
// 2.3 — Engage upstream: communication timeline
---

<div class="comms-wrap">
  <div class="comms-label">ENGAGEMENT TIMELINE</div>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="timeline-item timeline-good">
      <div class="tl-dot tl-dot-good"></div>
      <div class="tl-content">
        <div class="tl-phase">Before you start</div>
        <div class="tl-text">Open an issue or email. "We're planning a rewrite — would love to collaborate or at least share results."</div>
        <div class="tl-tag tl-tag-good">Recommended</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-item">
      <div class="tl-dot"></div>
      <div class="tl-content">
        <div class="tl-phase">During development</div>
        <div class="tl-text">Share progress, ask questions about edge cases, undocumented behaviour, or design intent.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-item">
      <div class="tl-dot"></div>
      <div class="tl-content">
        <div class="tl-phase">Before public release</div>
        <div class="tl-text">Give a heads-up so maintainers aren't blindsided. Minimum viable engagement.</div>
        <div class="tl-tag">Minimum bar</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline-item timeline-bad">
      <div class="tl-dot tl-dot-bad"></div>
      <div class="tl-content">
        <div class="tl-phase">After release — no contact</div>
        <div class="tl-text">Disrespects the people whose years of work you've built on. Damages open-source trust.</div>
        <div class="tl-tag tl-tag-bad">Avoid</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .comms-wrap {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .comms-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
    position: relative;
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .tl-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(-1 * var(--space-lg) - 4px);
    top: 4px;
  }

  .tl-dot-good {
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.4);
    border-color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.6);
  }

  .tl-dot-bad {
    background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.4);
    border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.6);
  }

  .tl-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .tl-phase {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .tl-text {
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .tl-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    display: inline-block;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .tl-tag-good {
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.08);
    color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.8);
    border-color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.2);
  }

  .tl-tag-bad {
    background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.08);
    color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.8);
    border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.2);
  }
</style>
